{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_stage_7_plan", "label": "Stage 7 executable plan (2026-08-03)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L1-L57", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_build_gap_vs_injection_point", "label": "BUILD GAP vs INJECTION POINT sorting rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every item is either the job (build gap) or a value we are waiting on (injection point). An injection point is never reported as a blocker \u2014 Ivan's standing correction that a missing key or approval does not stop the platform running end to end."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_task_7_1_background_fixes", "label": "Task 7.1 \u2014 land the two background-agent fixes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L15-L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "claude/busy-merkle-b00f7d (unaudited publish path \u2014 create-form publish skips publish_event(), so published_at is NULL and zero audit rows written) and claude/vigilant-wiles-093c38 (checkin_modes never exposed). Both branch from 7c28fd1 and both touch app/events/new/actions.ts, so the second must rebase, not force."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_deferred_item_56", "label": "DEFERRED item 56 \u2014 organiser\u2194body authorisation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L22-L25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "set_event_cpd_config() is authenticated-executable, so an organiser can bind their own event to any active body and self-assert accreditation. Not a security regression (every in-function gate holds) \u2014 what is missing is the product model of which organisation may claim which body. Minimum viable shape is an allow-list join (organisation \u00d7 accrediting_body, status); full approval workflow deferred to Stage 10."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_task_7_3_roster_licence_eligibility", "label": "Task 7.3 \u2014 roster licence eligibility", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L27-L28", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not a free RLS read: registrations has no user_id, public.users has no email, organiser staff have no read policy on practitioner_licences. Needs a SECURITY DEFINER function mirroring award_attendance_credit's identity chain, returning an eligibility enum and no PII. Good standing is status='verified', never 'active'."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_task_7_4_cpd_config_at_event_creation", "label": "Task 7.4 \u2014 CPD config at event creation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L30-L31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reuse set_event_cpd_config() from the create action; do NOT widen create_event_with_blocks' column whitelist \u2014 those columns were locked in July precisely to stop an organiser writing them directly."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_deferred_item_57", "label": "DEFERRED item 57 \u2014 attendance-credit window", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The credit window was a generous \u00b124h, not the event's own check-in window. Root cause: self_check_in enforced no time window, no checkin_modes.self_serve check and no publication check; the credit guard compensated at one remove."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_deferred_item_55", "label": "DEFERRED item 55 \u2014 credit_ledger advisory-lock timeout", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L35", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The global credit_ledger advisory lock has no acquisition timeout. Add SET LOCAL lock_timeout and degrade to skip rather than block the scanner; per-body chains remain the real fix at scale (Stage 10)."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_three_lens_protocol", "label": "Three-lens phase-completion protocol", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L37-L38", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dev lens, user lens (a different reviewer), and a live backtest against real systems. A single agent doing both lenses collapses them and misses defects living on the boundary. Requires separate review agents and Ivan's explicit go before spawning them."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_shared_local_stack_hazard", "label": "Background agents share ONE local Supabase stack", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A worktree agent applied 20260803023000_events_checkin_modes_rpcs.sql to the shared stack while the file existed only in that worktree, so main read 78 local files vs 79 applied. A supabase db reset on main would silently drop it. Reconcile files \u2194 applied list two-sided after every merge."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_set_event_cpd_config", "label": "set_event_cpd_config() audited definer function", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L23, L31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_exit_criteria", "label": "Stage 7 exit criteria", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L43-L50", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_stage_7_plan", "target": "docs_plans_stages_stages_md", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_stage_7_plan", "target": "docs_plans_stages_stage_7", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_stage_7_plan", "target": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_build_gap_vs_injection_point", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_stage_7_plan", "target": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_task_7_1_background_fixes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L15", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_stage_7_plan", "target": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_deferred_item_56", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-08-03-stage-7-plan.md", "source_location": "L22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_plans_2026_08_03_stage_7_plan_stage_7_plan", "target": "docs_plans_2026_08_